  <item>
    <title>023《我的天才女友》S1:用爱和嫉妒缠绕彼此，在贫民区中横冲直撞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672648a3cbe0e69c8b9d442f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672648a3cbe0e69c8b9d442f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Nov 2024 15:55:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们讨论的是电视剧《我的天才女友》第一季。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢本期，欢迎点赞、转发以及在评论区留言💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可以shownotes页面底部给我们打赏💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>紫娟</span></p><span></span><p><span>六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一部分：她们的友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">00:04:29</a> 莱农练习写字，不超出界限的隐喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">00:07:32</a> 娃娃事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">00:12:33</a> 看大海事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">00:14:16</a> 女性人物在友谊关系中的阴暗面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">00:22:25</a> 莉拉是莱农的催化剂</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二部分：那不勒斯城区的真相、莉拉的才华和婚姻的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">00:25:02</a> 堂·阿齐勒的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">00:27:52</a> 疯女人梅丽娜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">00:33:18</a> 分析多纳托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2184">00:36:24</a> 莉拉跟斯特凡诺结婚的原因，以及，斯特凡诺是什么样的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">00:40:37</a> 庶民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">00:46:30</a> 莉拉为何放弃写作与鞋子</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三部分：莱农的青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">00:54:20</a> 发育的乳房和受到的性骚扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3372">00:56:12</a> 初潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">00:58:52</a> 对身体的厌恶、和被性侵的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3776">01:02:56</a> 莱农为莉拉洗澡，对莉拉身体的描写分析</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目中提到的】</span></p><span></span><p><span>文章：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3oJdGFXO5-F8s5ehegNe0Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3oJdGFXO5-F8s5ehegNe0Q"><span>《王安忆：抹去——读埃莱娜·费兰特“那不勒斯四部曲”》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>书：《页边和听写》埃莱娜·费兰特</span></p><span></span><p><span>书《第二性》西蒙.德.波娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>书：《性别打结》艾伦·约翰逊</span></p><span></span><p><span>漫画：《灌篮高手》井上雄彦</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧《黑暗荣耀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《寄生虫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：MaxRichter-Whispers(From “MyBrilliant Friend” TVSeries Soundtrack)-电视剧《我的天才女友》插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：MaxRichter-Elena &amp; Lila(From “MyBrilliant Friend” TVSeries Soundtrack)-电视剧《我的天才女友》插曲</span></p>]]></description>
