  <item>
    <title>022《爱在午夜降临前》：模糊的责任，模糊的爱 | 乃声影视</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662f99f348581314504e1fb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662f99f348581314504e1fb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 13:00:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们讨论了爱在三部曲的最后一部：《爱在午夜降临前》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一部相较于前面两部，讨论的内容更贴近生活本身。展现了家庭生活中女性的许多困境，也展现了亲密关系中那些永远解决不完的矛盾和争吵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，爱是最小单位的共产主义吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们来聊一聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的听友记得点赞哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可以在shownotes页面底部或爱发电给我们发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself"><span>乃声FM爱发电</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【内容导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">00:05:25</a> 女人们的厨房、男人们的海边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">00:07:11</a> 饭桌上的笑话和舍不得公狗绝育的男主人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">00:11:00</a> 已婚男女会聊些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">00:17:33</a> 男性话语中的模糊性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">00:21:57</a> Jesse为出轨所作的辩解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">00:24:48</a> Celine的主体性受到了母亲身份的威胁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">00:31:07</a> 家务的纷争“我只能在拉屎的时候思考”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜紫娟，教练/职业规划师</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜紫娟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的书影】</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不够善良的我们》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《婚姻故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《职场妈妈不下班》[美]阿莉·拉塞尔·霍克希尔德</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头/片尾：Cela_-Graham_Reynolds</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llSiTYzT2IPmL2WY2VO8TGr5exOI.m4a" length="60289736" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsonIiE7WBUgUUCwh6-2Y0tAp_c6.png"/>
