  <item>
    <title>021 从食物中窥见世间的爱与权力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660661f51519139e4f5505f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660661f51519139e4f5505f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2024 06:38:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们向自己或向他人提的最多的几个问题，其中必有“早上吃什么”、“中午吃什么”、“晚上吃什么”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃，在我们的文化中占据着极其重要的位置。</span></p><span></span><p><span>简单果腹或是细品珍馐，一人赏味或是与人聚餐、节日文化或是拜神祭祖……</span></p><span></span><p><span>食物，存在于各种不同的场合，在我们的日常生活中起着太多不同的作用，也影响着我们与他人、与自己的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期录制时正临近清明节，我和紫娟刚吃了豆沙馅和芝麻馅的清明果，那么，就让我们从节日中的食物开始，聊一聊食物与关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的听友记得点赞哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果在爱发电给我们发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself"><span>乃声FM爱发电</span></a><span> 我们会更有动力更新！❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜紫娟，教练/职业规划师</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>排版｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">00:03:33</a> 粽子、年糕与饺子：围绕食物制作，我们与家人在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">00:09:43</a> 节日氛围淡，与食物也有很大的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">00:20:32</a> 家庭/家族内食物是否公平分配，影响亲人间的亲疏关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">00:27:05</a> 我也要吃大碗米饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">00:30:33</a> 童年禁忌食物：鸡心、活蛋、鱼籽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">00:37:54</a> 被吃掉的宠物兔子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">00:40:53</a> 家庭照顾者对饭桌上食物选择权的让渡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">00:43:40</a> 原来妈妈爱吃榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">00:49:36</a> 亲自做饭与爱的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">00:55:30</a> 一人食：好好吃饭，重视饮食，重新掌握对身体的权力</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的书影】</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《想做饭的女人和想吃饭的女人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《狗十三》</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《老派少女购物路线》洪爱珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>《女性主义疗法》[美]劳拉·S.布朗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：New Lands (Long version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：Scandinavianz - Dubrovnikmp3</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Dreamy – Spiring</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltu65deAe6mMHhAlE6uVVHjq9Qoc.m4a" length="85591760" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzKAdmQHImuaavPlp8R-prVJbOP.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>020 所谓长大，就是不断体验羞耻再努力克服羞耻的过程</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c1b5e30bef6c2074ad38c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c1b5e30bef6c2074ad38c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 04:30:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们来聊聊羞耻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着年龄增长，会让人感到羞耻的东西越来越多，羞耻感也会让人束手束脚，不敢大胆去行动、去表达，这不是我们自己选择的结果，而是社会文化和规范在影响着我们。我会觉得长大的过程中有一个必然要处理的功课，那就是想办法把羞耻感去掉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们所经历的羞耻远不止节目中谈到的这些；这是一个开关，一旦我们注意到它，在往后的生活中就会源源不断发现羞耻、然后去根除它们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有克服羞耻的经验，也欢迎在评论区跟我们分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的听友可以在爱发电给我们发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself"><span>乃声FM爱发电</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果你把本期节目分享给你的朋友们，我们会更开心！❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜紫娟，教练/职业规划师</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜紫娟</span></p><span></span><p><span>排版｜紫娟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">00:01:13</a> 冬天没有热水器的羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">00:04:52</a> 阶级差异在某种程度上是一种表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">00:07:42</a> 穿越奢侈品店的羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">00:10:35</a> 金钱欲望的羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">00:15:07</a> 《小狗钱钱》：做了喜欢的事情还要拿到报酬是天经地义的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">00:20:23</a> “无知”、“不知道怎么做”带来的羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">00:25:02</a> 村里奶奶的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">00:32:01</a> 耻于表达自己观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">00:38:04</a> 唱《小螺号》被嘲笑之后不敢再唱歌了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">00:42:06</a> 如果没有“某种标准”，羞耻恐怕就不会有</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的书籍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《羞耻》[法]安妮·埃尔诺</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小狗钱钱》[德] 博多·费舍尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我不相信神话》[意]奥莉娅娜·法拉奇</span></p><span></span><p><span>《女性的时刻》[美]梅琳达·盖茨</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的播客】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6558c3e316f3bfb3d3177a15" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6558c3e316f3bfb3d3177a15"><span>她是自由的野狗，她是法拉奇</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Tomh. x Kirikoukiri - 2 -SummerLove</span></p><span></span><p><span>中间：杨烁-小螺号</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾： Lana DelRey-Summertime Sadness</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luMeroS-NJ8sczz_gm4beXk8CM3A.m4a" length="70611154" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMjofBkm1FXn4tvHgGjbGk8HxZe.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>019 我们可不可以好好聊会天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658bee346396a4645a36b872</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658bee346396a4645a36b872</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Dec 2023 09:28:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>聊天体验是一件挺主观的事，却也是极大影响关系质量和亲密度的一件事。许多人并不看重聊天，以至于并不把“聊不好天”作为一件需要认真对待的事。可在我们看来，聊天是一门需要精进的技艺，好的聊天甚至是一种美学享受，会在多年后仍然回味那一场聊天带来的温馨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们想拆开来说说那些并不好的聊天方式，会带来差的体验的聊天方式，在往后的生活中，尽可能提醒自己，不要主动去制造这样的聊天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜紫娟 教练/职业规划师</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜六六</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜紫娟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a> 难以忘记的聊天体验：在隧道、在咖啡馆，也在书店里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">00:04:01</a> 在聊天中只关心自己，看不见对方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">00:07:36</a> 一张好用的表情包：「没人问你」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">00:11:18</a> 失落！跟朋友分享很开心的事情，对方接不住这个情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">00:15:47</a> 如果跟朋友只聊宏观议题、娱乐八卦，意味着并不亲密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">00:23:14</a> 一场因聊天内容而引发的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">00:27:23</a> 如何跟朋友表达对某些话题内容的抗拒和不满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">00:36:35</a> 朋友再细微的情绪都需要被尊重、被看见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">00:39:21</a> 困扰！严肃话题（诸如哲学社科政治）反而更容易跟新朋友聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">00:41:20</a> 爱在三部曲Seline和Jesse为什么聊得这么吸引人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">00:43:38</a> 相亲对象说：「我就是不会聊天」</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢本期节目，可以把它分享给你的朋友，或者是在爱发电给我们发电，谢谢你的支持和鼓励❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>发电链接：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/hearyourself"><span>爱发电</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的书籍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Unbound：A Woman’s Guide to Power》[美] Kasia·Urbaniak</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的影视】</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影：侯麦四季的故事系列</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：I Feel Alive</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Royal – ASHUTOSH</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关注/联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：乃声HearYourself</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：hearyourself@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liVZ_uq26UPwdCEj_0c0UchEJij0.m4a" length="72237736" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsR-Yk04oHo7VA2ZdDSxqBN630J9.png"/>
