  <item>
    <title>010《我的天才女友》莉拉：我们知道的越多，害怕的就越少｜乃声影视</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f1da6620298b975e35351a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f1da6620298b975e35351a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Aug 2022 03:54:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“伟大的文学作品之所以能流传下来，是因为读者心中会有某些东西跳出来，拥抱书中的真理。虚构人物的真理令我们感动，因为那是我们自己的真理。”——《存在主义心理治疗》</span></p><span></span><p><span>那不勒斯四部曲就是这样一部可以让我们读者、尤其是女性读者在其中找到自己身上潜藏的秘密的作品。我一直认为讨论作品中的人物是另一种探索自己的方式，所以本期我邀请子兰，一起聊聊女主人公之一莉拉，一位令人印象深刻、充满争议、也很富有吸引力的女性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播/嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：子兰，公众号@人类为何如此混蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：紫娟，新浪微博@娟笔刀</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">00:04:45</a> 埃莱娜·费兰特在《巴黎评论》中对这部作品的概括性表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">00:06:04</a> 那不勒斯四部曲的时代背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">00:09:10</a> 浅谈对莉拉的整体印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">00:14:47</a> 莱农和莉拉代表了两者不同的女性觉醒方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">00:18:25</a> 莉拉为什么和斯特凡诺结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">00:22:28</a> 尼诺代表的是一种女性陷阱：知识陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">00:27:30</a> 尼诺离开莉拉的神话隐喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">00:31:28</a> 莉拉和恩佐的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">00:33:55</a> 莉拉对待莱农的友情态度的波动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">00:40:06</a> 莉拉作为精神母亲的存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">00:48:57</a> 界限消失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">00:53:53</a> 莉拉的主动消失的含义</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的资料信息：</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《巴黎评论·女性作家访谈》，[美]巴黎评论编辑部</span></p><span></span><p><span>《家庭、私有制和国家的起源》，[德]弗里德里希·恩格斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ia411H74s?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=ee2e02df9f468b51c584ee9e5b7abcfa" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ia411H74s?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=ee2e02df9f468b51c584ee9e5b7abcfa"><span>太宰治的女人缘，与父权制的恶息息相关</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Max Richter-Whispers(From “My Brilliant Friend” TV Series Soundtrack)</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Max Richter-Elena &amp; Lila(From “My Brilliant Friend” TV Series</span></p><span></span><p><span>给节目发电：</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的听友可以在爱发电平台给我们发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@hearyourself" data-url="https://afdian.net/@hearyourself"><span>乃声电台HearYourself</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：hearyourself@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/likcgHXkoi4l4Nn5I0EiW1i4sxBy.m4a" length="86270310" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDGxEOxfXG5K5Nlv-nmCK_ozzq9.png"/>
